{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "dba316a651fae4eb9aff81aeee5167695b09ca4a8521e17ee45ef4c046f8c544", "ja": "迷走？　奔走！　いざ金沢へ", "zh": "迷茫？奔波！出发前往金泽", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e022af9e71d50c6733e37b1a566ac4a6bd92fbbfa15b4369c13058713593c6e5", "ja": "紬と歌織の投稿は思うように伸びない。\n「バズる」とはなかなか難しいものだと実感\nした2人は頭をひねるが、アイディアは迷走\n気味。そんな折、紬の故郷・金沢での仕事が\n入る。こうなれば金沢でネタ探しだ！", "zh": "紬和歌织的投稿并没有如愿获得增长。意识到“爆红”并非易事的2人绞尽脑汁，但想法似乎有些跑偏。就在这时，她们接到了在紬的故乡金泽工作的机会。既然如此，那就去金泽寻找素材吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "02f1bb4369ffc204b8fe1d67092cd8afd1006eb1bf6ba838a339373f5fd78689", "ja": "（SNSのネタ探しも大事だけど、他にもやる事は\n山積み。今日のふたりは、丸一日レッスンだ！）", "zh": "（找SNS素材也很重要，不过其他要做的事也堆积如山。今天两个人要整整练习一天！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "09c29f6387fdb3b222b1e304b15829e9a4a08f0f1745f703e359cdebdd29fe40", "ja": "ということで、新曲のレッスンの方は\nスケジュール表の通り進めればいいとして……。", "zh": "也就是说，新歌的练习照着日程表进行就行了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "faa51203c29c0c5bc7c28ef53c466dd23580e7e341a7ba5e71f75748b120cbcf", "ja": "問題はSNSの企画、ですよね。\n私たちの投稿も反応はもらえていますけど……。", "zh": "问题出在社交平台的企划上，对吧。\n虽然我们发布的动态也收到了一些反响……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1003_052kao", "source_sha256": "737dea82bfc8fecbead59f14af33fc493916a17bfddd87f764474bdd7e7d6be2", "ja": "バズった、とはまだまだ言えない数字です。\n他の参加者の人たちは、文字通り桁が違って……。", "zh": "还不能说是走红了。这个数字还差得远呢。\n其他参加者的数据，简直就是天壤之别……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "773d75b0dffd7af1da237a267ffe5f60cb5f734b4895c806164930b16f5aa96e", "ja": "曲芸のように料理をしたり、楽器で流行の曲を\n演奏したり……見ているだけで飽きません。", "zh": "有人像杂技演员一样烹饪，有人用乐器演奏流行歌曲……光是看着就百看不厌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e400e0007731752d5312ebdc8a82e04e578de5106bb71943e76465106b60c499", "ja": "みなさん、本当に真摯です。SNSへの投稿なら\n手軽と言った過去の自分が、浅はかでした。", "zh": "大家真的都很认真。之前轻率地觉得在SNS上\n发动态很简单，过去的自己实在太肤浅了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1006_p", "source_sha256": "18d2787a7c28e8412cd25976d57e6c5aabfd821a7fc0d49f77a1cd37bab766fa", "ja": "映像編集も凝っているしな。なにより、魅力を\n分かっているからこその見せ方というか……。", "zh": "视频剪辑也很用心。更重要的是，这种呈现方式，正是因为了解其中的魅力才能做到的吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "17d0d5dac409cb8c3ca333dd78e59879a6a1b3e97a655a4f2cafbf717c7f562a", "ja": "ここから大台に乗るには、いわゆるバズを狙うには、\nふたりのシナジーが必要だと思う。", "zh": "要想从这里再上一个台阶，要想制造所谓的热门话题，我认为需要你们两人的协同效应。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9c653844799198ed75d2767b81f1e94287b111bb0804aaedff2e0f9893bfec90", "ja": "シナジー……ですか？\nそれは一体、どういう……。", "zh": "协同效应……吗？\n那到底是指什么……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8482edf76a7c63226a3db81ba7a90a14dec802e80741f572c43638af37b8f2b1", "ja": "ああ。相乗効果というか、ふたりならではの\n魅力を収めた投稿ができたらって。", "zh": "啊。也就是所谓的协同效应吧，我是想，要是能发布一篇展现我们两人独有魅力的投稿就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1010_052kao", "source_sha256": "f4d4239af1981205695715e3583be3850b112ab7385e42c7f7c2e00454ba76a9", "ja": "ふたりならでは……確かに。今回は\n私たち、ユニットとしての活動ですものね。", "zh": "独属于我们两人的……确实。这次是我们以组合形式展开的活动呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "ec9109942c26412bd86b9a0a2ee5d1e686d1b53056725a9befb84b48c04660ac", "ja": "でも、シナジー……今日はレッスンを撮ろうと\n思っていたけれど、それだけだと弱いのかしら……？", "zh": "不过，协同效应……我本来想着今天拍摄练习的内容，可如果只有这个，或许还是不够有说服力……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5237c027c88c9b1dc7ffc878ae61d56de02a9e02d683c795950c9af6649207f3", "ja": "もしかしたら、そうなのかもしれません……。\n私になにかできることと言えば……。", "zh": "说不定，还真有可能是这样……\n要说我能做到的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "28013cf339b0b2248ca8e61382c7777b41206d6d3c6466d764867ee2d3a09463", "ja": "新曲を三味線でアレンジする、とか……？", "zh": "要不要试着用三味线改编新歌……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "9549e62f0d122eebc088c272fbd892790b954b3472686d62e888b7f532d8748f", "ja": "三味線アレンジ……。", "zh": "三味线改编……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c441509af86f6356eb6a2c0f67437f447e42ced0d6b5e23111bedb77da658f9b", "ja": "い、いえ、ただ思い付きを口に出しただけで、\n本気で捉える必要は……。", "zh": "不、不是的，我只是随口一说，\n您不必当真……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1016_052kao", "source_sha256": "131ce5c63fce58454b47e8addba414fa60373bf8fec220b1495356ed8f5b061b", "ja": "いいえ、アイディアを出すのは大事だもの。\n私が何かを加えてシナジーを出すには……。", "zh": "不，提出想法是很重要的。\n如果想让我加入点什么来产生协同效应的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1017_052kao", "source_sha256": "da95a14e7257a1bfbbdd3b5bbfcf7d46697846c08bc8b3b8eccaca4f0f8c649c", "ja": "……乗馬、よね。\n三味線をお馬さんの上で……。", "zh": "……骑马，对吧。\n在小马上弹三味线的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "47d27b19094a946f001481be9a73d8dd01dcad18d626aa3a99c1c5097d4c51c9", "ja": "ま、まあ落ち着きましょう。インパクトは\nありますけど、それだとレッスンになりませんし。", "zh": "呃、呃，先冷静一下吧。虽然确实很有冲击力，但那样就没法练习了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1019_052kao", "source_sha256": "a1425032a496a771b2d83c2aaa322dbb65e34b535d7000d13261bdcf81a5b85e", "ja": "そ、そうですよね……。ちょっと、\n考えが変な方向にいってたかしら……。", "zh": "是、是啊……。我是不是有点想偏了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1020_p", "source_sha256": "8f3fc254f2f2832a6176cfed05e874841b53e9c18a7dfacdc227c984d13d02cd", "ja": "ふたりがネタ探しに真剣なのはわかりました。\nでも、まだ未完成のユニットですから。", "zh": "我明白你们两个是在认真寻找素材。\n不过，毕竟还是个尚未成形的组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "de682d4cb2e385757c70ec6f297685d007f66466a38b010e330c0c2fe4628115", "ja": "しかし……シナジーが必要だと言ったのは\n他ならぬ{$P$}ですよ？", "zh": "可是……说需要协同效应的，不正是{$P$}吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1022_p", "source_sha256": "bf8c1e524afac3e03152234967bce038a13b91e8f76bd517153a155480f9a084", "ja": "うん。そこで、アイディアなんだけど……\nこの、金沢での仕事を受けるのはどうだろう？", "zh": "嗯。所以，我有个想法……要不要接下这份在金泽的工作？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1023_p", "source_sha256": "0974f5ccd8f92ef98b909833d3fd8bb41ed87f22e54e64bee60a742f7531197d", "ja": "ラジオとかグルメレポートとか依頼が来ているんだ。\nあくまでアイドルらしく、活路を見出そう！", "zh": "收到了广播节目、美食报道之类的工作邀请。\n让我们以偶像的身份寻找突破口吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1024_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f988b0e0bf016c1a11d9b6bcf67e2da2378fb75e96f121b35c7545f31316b2d8", "ja": "なるほど。\n私の生まれ故郷でのお仕事……はっ！？", "zh": "原来如此。\n在我的故乡开展工作……啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1025_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ad81758cc898ccad67cb672a81c393cd11bd28d37a77ec5409dba052d65715bb", "ja": "まさか、故郷で恥を晒すとなれば、\n私も背水の陣で臨むだろうと……？", "zh": "难道是觉得，要是在故乡丢脸的话，我也会抱着背水一战的决心去面对……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1026_p", "source_sha256": "f49158238eb3af90229c9a84297e208ecdd01ac95fe9dedad73f9729fd6c271e", "ja": "違う違う！\nたまたま仕事が来ただけであって……。", "zh": "不是不是！只是碰巧接到了这份工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1027_052kao", "source_sha256": "4a6e5fdf835a3770db4954d7b880079e0ed6a853d33f27d58ef00e7af42e49c3", "ja": "金沢でのお仕事……素敵なアイディアですね！\n私も紬ちゃんのこと、もっと知りたいし……。", "zh": "在金泽的工作……真是个好主意！\n我也想进一步了解紬……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "d3eae6413cfe10231c116543c0d5da5fd3965ce5ea025e37711c2d0571e8da2f", "ja": "それに、地元の力を借りればシナジーっていうのも\n生まれやすいんじゃないかしら？", "zh": "而且，如果能借助当地的力量，说不定也更容易产生所谓的协同效应呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1029_p", "source_sha256": "c0001f05804be76b129932e21d29da3be9a277d627542cee371fee3e7f950362", "ja": "そうなんです！　紬の地元の力を借りて、\nふたりのシナジーを引き出せたらいいなと。", "zh": "就是这样！我想借助紬家乡的力量，\n要是能发挥出两人的协同效应就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1030_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e48c08a646f2fdbcbe59a58c4de7f6119ff05b68ad9058b2200bf5317afdc9e3", "ja": "な、なるほど……地元の力を借りる……。\nそういうことでしたら、私も異論はありません。", "zh": "原、原来如此……借助家乡的力量……  \n既然是这样，我也没有异议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1031_052kao", "source_sha256": "1b8e2a8abac285e43d27b31146e201c37bf15ead83eed8d648b222f81675650a", "ja": "よかった♪\nそれなら次は金沢でネタ探しね！", "zh": "太好了♪\n那下次就去金泽找题材吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0284_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0284_story_03_1032_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d1a27ee28806bb8ca38d8f97c2f2b57ea9032d021c7b0b213c517e3b2ed80dc6", "ja": "はい。勝手知ったる地元ですから。\nなんとしても、成果を残してみせます！", "zh": "是的。毕竟这是我熟悉的故乡。无论如何，我一定会拿出成果来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
